= The Firewall Cracks

For the second time since January 2025, a CDU/CSU motion has passed the Bundestag only because the AfD voted for it. This time the Union leadership did not even pretend to regret it: "We will not let the AfD decide what we may vote for," said a deputy party leader. The AfD is celebrating it as the beginning of the end of the "Brandmauer".

- @strategy: We must develop a coherent strategy to defend the firewall.

@strategy
view-if: afd_urgency < 3
on-arrival: afd_urgency += 1

We do not yet have a coherent strategy against the far right. We must develop one as soon as possible.
